        {
          "text": " Ndyabaha omutima gw'okummanya ku niinye MUKAMA; kandi baryaba abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo, ahabw'okuba baryangarukira n'omutima gwabo gwona.",
          "type": "text",
